    "detailed_description": "A fully live-action immersive interactive movie game where you play as an ordinary urban youth. An accident awakens an ancient artifact hidden within you, instantly making you the focal point of a three-way struggle among celestial, earthly, and underworld factions. Their methods vary\u2014coercion, bribery, or feigned alliances\u2014and every choice you make ripples outwards, shifting the world's balance and rewriting your own destiny.<br><br>The game uses full live-action filming with cinematic storytelling, multi-branching narratives, and real-time interactive gameplay, placing you in a high-stakes vortex of power struggles and life-or-death trials. Will you follow fate or defy it? Prioritize yourself or dominate others? Your unique ending is in your hands.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/776ac2c83b5f7e6baed6bd09888523de.avif?t=1754297946\" width=615 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/9da431d87279b753c5d6bd45c17d7419.poster.avif?t=1754297946\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/9da431d87279b753c5d6bd45c17d7419.webm?t=1754297946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/9da431d87279b753c5d6bd45c17d7419.mp4?t=1754297946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It features full live-action filming for immersion, offers multi-branching storylines where player choices genuinely impact character fates (no false choices), and builds a vast, complete 2.5-dimensional urban fantasy world. This provides rich story exploration, multi-perspective plotlines, and diverse narrative experiences.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/a38e7fc1974e42e1ee7458157b178f2b.avif?t=1754297946\" width=615 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/f83a74c45168fccc4c3d42f3f1afbe25.poster.avif?t=1754297946\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/f83a74c45168fccc4c3d42f3f1afbe25.webm?t=1754297946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/f83a74c45168fccc4c3d42f3f1afbe25.mp4?t=1754297946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Qingqiu: The Enigmatic Source - Mysterious origins (Heaven/Hell?), controls emotions, carries deep secrets.<br>Wu Huan: The Rebel CEO - Leads the Celestial Path Group, funds demon hunters but seeks to expel them, challenges divine authority.<br>Wu Jin: The Grandmaster Schemer - Resents sister's shadow, mentored by Jiang Hao, obsessed with Jiang Yi, manipulates destinies.<br>Yao Wanqing: The Walled Heart - Childhood trauma built strong defenses, fiercely competitive, thaws only for Jiang Yi.<br>Keren: The Double-Bind Dilemma - Glamorous gang leader's wife on the surface, actually a pawn and sacrifice, torn between love and duty.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/142e7cdd222ff928ad70507b8d37c742.avif?t=1754297946\" width=615 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/2c3045448c6469ae356778c0c05c7c93.poster.avif?t=1754297946\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/2c3045448c6469ae356778c0c05c7c93.webm?t=1754297946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/2c3045448c6469ae356778c0c05c7c93.mp4?t=1754297946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>An actor-turned-producer ensures strict quality control, particularly focusing on actresses' appearance and acting skills. Actors undergo over ten days of professional acting and martial arts training before filming. Leveraging industry connections, the producer secured support from stars like Yu Wenwen, effectively boosting the project's visibility.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/eac3729595da1a2e3f2ee1ec52df32b3.avif?t=1754297946\" width=615 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/5a4593a61943d0935be2b6c908253f94.poster.avif?t=1754297946\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/5a4593a61943d0935be2b6c908253f94.webm?t=1754297946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/5a4593a61943d0935be2b6c908253f94.mp4?t=1754297946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As China's first work to achieve this blend, it innovatively fuses Eastern fantasy with modern urban themes. The story is based on original, fictional ancient mythology and history, presenting unique and novel narrative content.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/9ed979a77da1fc63d7b1839f5755dcfa.avif?t=1754297946\" width=615 height=51 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/3bc689e32882dcc58ca4b39cc64992c7.poster.avif?t=1754297946\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/3bc689e32882dcc58ca4b39cc64992c7.webm?t=1754297946\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460110/extras/3bc689e32882dcc58ca4b39cc64992c7.mp4?t=1754297946\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>It combines live-action performances with real-time interactive gameplay to deepen immersion. Chapter 3 specifically features a full puzzle-solving segment, significantly enhancing fun, challenge, and the game's layered experience.",
